Alfie Gallagher is a cryptozoologist in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] and a consultant the [[Org/The Scale/index|Scale]] uses from time to time. He runs a small curiosities museum in the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Masque District/index|Masque District]]. When the Party were looking into the [[Ugathal]], the dossier [[Org/The Scale/People/Dame Quay|Dame Quay]] sent them named Gallagher as the person who would know more.
